cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Keel or its weights, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Keel: an open-weight, local System One decision model"
abstract: >-
  Keel answers typed decision questions (choice, score, yes/no) for coding agents with a
  small in-process ONNX cross-encoder. It speaks a System One-compatible HTTP wire and an
  MCP bridge, runs on CPU, and makes no network call on the decision path.
authors:
  - name: "The Keel Authors"
version: 3.0.0-rc.1
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/neerumsr/Keel"
url: "https://huggingface.co/neerumsr/keel-3"
keywords:
  - decision model
  - cross-encoder
  - natural language inference
  - zero-shot classification
  - ONNX
  - coding agents
  - Model Context Protocol
references:
